{"synopsis":"Setelah terlahir kembali ke dalam sebuah novel, Shuryna, yang mengetahui takdirnya, berencana untuk menjadi seorang ksatria sihir dan pensiun dengan kaya raya. Namun, rintangan terbesarnya adalah empat pria yang jatuh cinta pada sahabatnya, Hestia. Mereka seharusnya mengejar Hestia tetapi ingin Shuryna menjadi mak comblang mereka. Dia menolak karena peran itulah yang menyebabkan pengusirannya, tetapi para pria itu tak kenal lelah. Dapatkah Shuryna meraih masa pensiun kaya raya yang sangat dia dambakan? Atau akankah ketertarikan Hestia pada pria-pria itu kembali menyebabkan kehancurannya?","alternative_title":"오작교는 싫습니다","author":"Fat-weighted Cricket, Marisea","artist":"Clover (II)","chapters":[{"number":"113","chapter":"113","slug":"cd3c5436-aa1d-4033-8385-2516196ba096","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"112","chapter":"112","slug":"69cb4918-3d0a-4e1b-b58f-243a0b2fe2a0","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"number":"111","chapter":"111","slug":"de90dc92-0c4c-435b-8925-107b1e310c15","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"110","chapter":"110","slug":"06de2e04-4c28-4850-842d-dd257c0cffb9","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"109","chapter":"109","slug":"e74a7f1a-e526-4913-84cf-77424f8a3c79","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"108","chapter":"108","slug":"d2781453-e17a-4a28-af44-c4ef8d8c6e32","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"107","chapter":"107","slug":"8f33522b-1dd5-4573-bbae-e7c9ff6f048c","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"106","chapter":"106","slug":"41de7208-9b4b-4036-8058-b75adafb50eb","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"105","chapter":"105","slug":"ceca2cbd-b84a-4b4a-b8e4-e1f574223371","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"104","chapter":"104","slug":"33ebb1a7-d518-4108-a8c3-92f2dc8ddab0","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"103","chapter":"103","slug":"7ec822a5-9a97-4410-a958-ec6ed98f0720","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"102","chapter":"102","slug":"9d291cdf-f31e-4428-a86